&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10.35pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.5pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 14.21pt; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Revolving&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Loan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;Fund&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 13.5pt 19.2pt 0 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Cooperative has established a rural economic development revolving loan pool. The pool was established through&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;USDA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;rural&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;economic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;grant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$40,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;contribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;by&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.2pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cooperative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;These funds, along with any interest earnings, are to be used to finance rural economic development projects in accordance with the Cooperative's rural development plan as approved by RUS. In accordance with the grant agreement, the Cooperative has segregated the revolving loan pool.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;div style="clear: both"&gt; 				&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 6%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 					&lt;span style="height: 0; display: block; position: absolute; z-index: -65537"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/png;base64," width="25" height="18" alt="" style="margin-top: -10.26pt; margin-left: 507.84pt; position: absolute" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 				&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;/div&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt; 		&lt;br style="page-break-before: always; clear: both" /&gt; 		&lt;div class="Section_24"&gt; 			&lt;div style="clear: both"&gt; 				&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 6%; font-size: 10pt"&gt; 					&lt;span style="height: 0; display: block; position: absolute; z-index: -65538"&gt;&lt;img src="data:image/png;base64," width="306" height="58" alt="" style="margin-top: -1.02pt; margin-left: 294.02pt; position: absolute" /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="height: 0; display: block; posi