;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 11.25pt 19.2pt 0 18pt; text-indent: -0.05pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cooperative's&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;bylaws&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;were&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amended&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1992&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;allow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;board&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;directors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;set&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;aside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;quot;unallocated reserve&amp;quot; nonoperating interest income margins received in any year that those margins are not required to offset losses incurred. In accordance with this bylaw provision, the board of directors set aside $2,076,545 and&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$2,126,831&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;nonoperating&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;interest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;margins&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;unallocated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;reserves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.25pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.35pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin: 13.4pt 19.2pt 0 18pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;During 1996, the Cooperative amended its bylaws pertaining to the return of patron's capital contributed to them. The Cooperative subsequently offered patrons a return of the total amount of the capital they had contributed, upon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;condition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;that&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.05pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;amount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;equal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;patronage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;retired,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;discounted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.15pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;of money, would be retained by the Cooperative as a Class &amp;quot;B&amp;quot; patronage capital. This Class &amp;quot;B&amp;quot; patronage capital would be retired only upon dissolution of the Cooperative. Under this program, the Cooperative has retired&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;$3,781,120,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="letter-spacing: -0.4pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span styl